01:02:40,000 --> 01:02:46,000
Breakin' 2: Electric Boogaloo is a 1984 American breakdancing musical film directed by Sam Firstenberg that is a
sequel to Breakin', released seven months earlier the same year by the same producers, The Cannon Group.

11
01:08:56,000 --> 01:09:02,000
In markets where the earlier film was titled Breakdance, the sequel
was released as Breakdance 2: Electric Boogaloo.

12
01:15:12,000 --> 01:15:18,000
Another sequel, Rappin' (also known as Breakdance 3), was produced but with an unconnected
plot and different lead characters; only Ice-T appears in all three films.

13
01:21:28,000 --> 01:21:34,000
The subtitle "Electric Boogaloo" has entered the popular-culture lexicon
as a snowclone nickname to denote an archetypal sequel.

14
01:27:44,000 --> 01:27:50,000
The tone is emotional.
